    {
      "ja": "• 足のパーツの差し替えにより脚部の折りたたみギミックを再現。",
      "en": "• Reproduce the folding gimmick of the legs by replacing the leg parts."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• ２種類の目は選択式。",
      "en": "• Two types of eyes are selectable."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• カスタムしやすい２つ穴ジョイントを搭載。",
      "en": "• Equipped with a two-hole joint that is easy to customize."
